### Purpose: Lesson booking/confirmation flow (VS Code REST Client).
### Flow notes:
### - Paste `tutorId`, `availabilityId`, and `subjectId` from other flows.
### - Use after admin/tutor/student flows so tokens and IDs exist.
### Environment:
### - Select "local" in VS Code REST Client environments (from .vscode/settings.json).

### Admin login
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

###

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Tutor login
# @name tutorLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{tutorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{tutorPassword}}"
}

###

@tutorToken = {{tutorLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Student login
# @name studentLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{studentEmail}}",
  "password": "{{studentPassword}}"
}

###

@studentToken = {{studentLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Book a lesson (uses availability id)
# @name bookLesson
POST {{baseUrl}}/tutors/{{tutorId}}/lessons/book
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "availabilityId": "{{availabilityId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}",
  "topic": "Linear equations"
}

###

@lessonId = {{bookLesson.response.body.lesson.id}}
@bookingId = {{bookLesson.response.body.booking.id}}

### Student confirms lesson completion (use after scheduled end time)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "note": "Lesson went well"
}

### Tutor confirms lesson completion (use after scheduled end time)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/confirm/tutor
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "note": "Student was prepared"
}

### Admin view pending confirmations
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/confirmations?state=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin view a lesson's confirmations
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/confirmations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin resolve stalled lesson (complete or cancel)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "complete",
  "note": "Resolved by admin"
}

### Admin override confirmations (optional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/confirmations/override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorConfirmed": true,
  "tutorNote": "Override confirmation",
  "bookings": [
    {
      "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}",
      "completed": true,
      "note": "Confirmed by admin"
    }
  ]
}

### Student cancel booking (refunds only before lesson day)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Student rebooks the same lesson after canceling
# @name rebookLesson
POST {{baseUrl}}/tutors/{{tutorId}}/lessons/book
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "availabilityId": "{{availabilityId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}",
  "topic": "Rebooked lesson"
}

### Admin cancel a lesson (refunds all booked students)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin resolve a stalled lesson (complete)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "complete",
  "note": "Admin resolved"
}

### Admin reschedule a lesson to a new availability slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "availabilityId": "{{availabilityId}}",
  "note": "Rescheduled by admin"
}
